#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:155
msgid "通过源码安装Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Installing Triton-Ascend Using the Source Code"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:157
msgid ""
"如果您需要对 Triton-Ascend "
"进行开发或自定义修改，则应采用源代码编译安装的方法。这种方式允许您根据项目需求调整源代码，并编译安装定制化的 Triton-Ascend 版本。"
msgstr ""
"If you need to develop or customize Triton-Ascend, you should install it "
"by compiling from source. This method allows you to modify the source "
"code according to your project requirements and build a customized "
"version of Triton-Ascend."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:159
msgid "在构建前，您需要完成相关构建组件的<a href=\"#code-require\">依赖安装</a>。"
msgstr ""
"Before building, you need to install the required build dependencies as "
"outlined in <a href=\"#code-require\">Dependency Installation</a>."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:161
msgid ""
"我们推荐使用<a href=\"#auto-code-base\">快速安装</a>的方式完成基于源码安装Triton-"
"Ascend；若您有特殊需求，如目标机器无法联网等原因，可以进行<a href=\"#hand-code-base\">手动安装</a>。"
msgstr ""
"We recommend completing the source installation of Triton-Ascend using "
"the <a href=\"#auto-code-base\">Quick Installation</a> method. If you "
"have special requirements, such as no network access on the target "
"machine, you can use <a href=\"#hand-code-base\">Manual Installation</a> "
"instead."

